but it'll attack even a glove,

00:43:18.450 --> 00:43:22.020
and why it will only try and mate

00:43:22.020 --> 00:43:24.570
if there's another mouse to mate with?

00:43:24.570 --> 00:43:28.290
It's actually, I think,
fortunately for you,

