00:44:40.530 --> 00:44:41.430
- But what you're raising here

00:44:41.430 --> 00:44:46.050
is a very interesting mechanistic scenario

00:44:46.050 --> 00:44:49.500
that can, and as you
mentioned, is being explored.

00:44:49.500 --> 00:44:54.500
So what do we know about the
internal state of a mouse

00:44:54.630 --> 00:44:57.000
whose VMH is being stimulated

00:44:57.000 --> 00:45:00.660
or a mouse whose other brain region

00:45:00.660 --> 00:45:03.330
that can stimulate the desire to mate,

00:45:03.330 --> 00:45:05.610
what do we know about the
internal state of that mouse

00:45:05.610 --> 00:45:07.620
if it's just alone in the
